I walk forward.
On the way, I see a shop.
There are many things for the home there.
I see a beautiful mug.
There are beautiful pictures on the mug.
I want that mug.
I ask the shopkeeper.
"Brother, what is the price of this mug?" I say.
The shopkeeper looks at the mug.
He says, "Madam, its price is five hundred rupees."
Five hundred rupees!
This price is very high.
I do not want the mug now.
I smile gently.
"I do not need it right now, thank you," I say.
The shopkeeper nods his head.
I go to the next shop.
